==== Removed configuration ====
* $wgWebPThumbnailType has been removed. WebP images are served as WebP
  thumbnails unconditionally.
* $wgStatsdServer and $wgStatsdMetricPrefix, deprecated since 1.25
  and unused since 1.45, have been removed. For StatsD support, see:
  https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Manual:Stats.
