=== Breaking changes in 1.48 ===

* ResourceLoader::inDebugMode(), deprecated since 1.47, has been
  removed.
* MediaWikiServices::getPerDbNameStatsdDataFactory(), deprecated since 1.44,
  has been removed. Use StatsFactory with wiki ID from
  WikiMap::getCurrentWikiId() as label instead.
* TextSlotDiffRenderer::setStatsdDataFactory(), deprecated since 1.43,
  has been removed.
* MediaWikiServices::getStatsFactory() and
  StatsFactory::withStatsdDataFactory(), deprecated since 1.45,
  has been removed.
* LanguageQqx::getMessage(), deprecated since 1.41, has been removed
  along with the LanguageQqx class. Use
  LanguageFactory::getLanguage( 'qqx' ) instead.
* SpecialEmailUser::getTarget(), deprecated since 1.42, has been
  removed.
* The $request parameter of EditPage::importFormData(),
  hard-deprecated since 1.47, has been removed.
* MediaWikiIntegrationTestCase::assertSelect(), deprecated since 1.47,
  has been removed.
* MediaWikiIntegrationTestCase::assertArraySubmapSame(), deprecated since 1.47,
  has been removed.
* The EditPageBeforeConflictDiff hook, deprecated since 1.47, has
  been removed.
* SpecialVersion::getExtensionTypeName(), deprecated since 1.47, has
  been removed.
* TextboxBuilder::mergeClassesIntoAttributes(), deprecated since 1.44,
  has been removed.
* PrefixSearch, StringPrefixSearch and TitlePrefixSearch, deprecated
  since 1.27, have been removed. Use SearchEngine::completionSearch()
  instead.
* The PagerTools class, deprecated since 1.47, has been removed. Use
  the ChangeToolsFactory service instead.
* SamplingStatsdClient, deprecated since 1.43, has been removed.
* StatsdAwareInterface, deprecated since 1.45, has been removed.
* The following methods of Title have been removed:
  - getOtherPage (deprecated since 1.34)
  - estimateRevisionCount (deprecated since 1.47)
  - isAlwaysKnown (deprecated since 1.47)
* The hook CategoryViewer__generateLinkHook, deprecated in 1.47, has been
  removed. Use the hook CategoryViewerGenerateLinkHook instead.
* …

=== Deprecations in 1.48 ===

* Xml::escapeTagsOnly() is unused and has been deprecated.
* …

